   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Bold editorial: deep blacks (~8), clean bright whites (~236), high saturation (0.48), rich deep reds and warm skin with luminous highlights. Best for: Statement frames: bride portraits with red / pink lehengas, dramatic wide venue shots, big-light stage moments, couple portraits at golden hour. Best on well-exposed, well-lit frames.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
